@startuml
!theme plain
title Learning Lab — live component responsibilities

package "Input + observation" {
  component "adapters" as Adapters
  component "inspector" as Inspector
}

package "Definition" {
  component "modeller" as Modeller
  component "taskmodel" as TaskModel
}

package "Task families" {
  component "reservation" as Reservation
  component "enrichment" as Enrichment
  component "aggregation" as Aggregation
  component "reconciliation" as Reconciliation
}

package "Deterministic operation" {
  component "worker" as Worker
  component "fleet" as Fleet
  component "calendar_job" as CalendarJob
}

package "Interpretation + improvement" {
  component "supervisor" as Supervisor
}

Adapters --> Inspector : structural data
Inspector --> Modeller : observed facts / evidence
Modeller --> TaskModel : explicit task model
TaskModel --> Reservation
TaskModel --> Enrichment
TaskModel --> Aggregation
TaskModel --> Reconciliation
Reservation --> Worker
Enrichment --> Worker
Aggregation --> Worker
Reconciliation --> Worker
Worker --> Fleet : established worker state / runs
CalendarJob --> Worker : unattended reservation path
Fleet --> Supervisor : fleet context / exceptions / map state
Supervisor ..> Fleet : investigation / improvement proposals

note right of Modeller
Current DEFINE surface.
Large pipeline remains live product code.
end note

note right of Fleet
Owns established fleet/operations and
derives the read-only system map from authority-bearing state.
end note

note right of Supervisor
May interpret, investigate and propose.
Does not silently establish/promote/execute authority-bearing changes.
end note
@enduml
